      "side": 1,
      "message": "This change is required because the QSPI controller is connected to a SPI-NOR storage device. The recovery image contains binaries for both SPI-NOR and NVMe storage devices. During the recovery process, the QSPI controller reads the SPI-NOR binaries from the recovery image and writes them to the SPI-NOR storage device. Therefore, this Qualcomm vendor-specific driver change is required to support SPI-NOR access during recovery operations",
